      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. It seems like the systemic risk to the investment landscape is much more concrete than the benefits. Looking at the volatility you mentioned, do you think the economic volatility from this transition could actually jeopardize overall national economic stability, or is it just a sectoral issue?",
